### All courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses
### Create (201): use the returned Location for the next requests
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"SE411","name":"Software Construction","description":"Lab course","credits":3}

### Read: replace 3 with the created id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/3

### Update (204)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/3
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"SE411","name":"Updated Construction","description":"Updated lab course","credits":4}

### Delete (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/3

### Invalid request (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":-1,"code":"","name":"X","credits":11}
